Initial actions: 
(V1): V1 drives on Lane 2 at 82 km/h, following V2; (V2): V2 drives on Lane 2 at 84 km/h, maintaining a steady speed; (V3): V3 drives on Lane 3 at 80 km/h, holding its lane alongside V1; (V4): V4 drives on Lane 1 at 86 km/h, intending to move forward more aggressively.


Interactive pattern sequence: 

(V4, V1): V4 swerves left from Lane 1 onto the shoulder and then cuts into Lane 2, positioning itself between V1 and V2;
(V2, V4): V2 brake from 84 km/h to 76 km/h as V4 cuts into lane 2 in front of it;
(V1, V2): V1 decelerates from 82 km/h to 58 km/h reacting to V2’s braking and the slower speed of V4;
(V3, V1): V3 brake from 80 km/h to 62 km/h as V1 decelerates sharply and slightly swerve left;
(V4, V2): V4 brake from 74 km/h to 64 km/h as V2 reduces speed;
(V1, V4): V1 continue to decelerate and is unable to shed enough speed to avoid hitting V4.

